### MCDT Input Injection & Actions
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:25580
@token = test-token

### 1. Synthetic keyboard key tap (e.g. Escape key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/input/keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "escape",
  "action": "tap"
}

### 2. Synthetic keyboard text typing
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/input/keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello Minecraft"
}

### 3. Synthetic mouse move
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/input/mouse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "move",
  "x": 400.0,
  "y": 300.0
}

### 4. Synthetic mouse scroll wheel
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/input/mouse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "scroll",
  "scrollDeltaY": 1.0
}

### 5. Chat history retrieval
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 6. Player orientation / look (requires player loaded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/player/look
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "yaw": 90.0,
  "pitch": 0.0
}

### 7. Player movement input (requires player loaded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/player/move
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forward": true,
  "jump": false,
  "ticks": 10
}
